    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The close command can be used to close a GitHub issue or pull request.",
      "source_hash": 3511167083023386543,
      "context_hash": 16350497414917433190,
      "translation": "close 명령을 사용하여 GitHub 이슈나 풀 리퀘스트를 닫을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "pull request": "풀 리퀘스트",
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:47:20.930347Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Usage",
      "source_hash": 8769925957682373409,
      "context_hash": 12921603243393476367,
      "translation": "사용법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:47:20.930347Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "To close an issue or pull request, any rust-lang team member may enter the command:",
      "source_hash": 10915527469495189534,
      "context_hash": 15722618963275511655,
      "translation": "이슈나 풀 리퀘스트를 닫으려면 rust-lang 팀 구성원 누구나 다음 명령을 입력할 수 있습니다:## Translator's note I kept \"rust-lang 팀 구성원\" and did not use \"언어 팀\". The flagged term is a false match. \"rust-lang team member\" means a member of any team in the rust-lang organization, not the language team (\"lang team\"). Writing \"rust-lang 언어 팀 구성원\" (as in Draft 2) would wrongly limit the command to language team members.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "team member": "팀 구성원",
        "Rust": "Rust",
        "pull request": "풀 리퀘스트",
        "lang team": "언어 팀",
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:47:20.930348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "This will immediately close the issue or PR.",
      "source_hash": 2553514430458309569,
      "context_hash": 4811867170609252588,
      "translation": "이 명령을 입력하면 해당 이슈나 PR이 즉시 닫힙니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:47:20.930349Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuration",
      "source_hash": 4935613502183038470,
      "context_hash": 17331054691093410373,
      "translation": "설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:47:20.930349Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This feature is enabled on a repository by having a `[close]` table in `triagebot.toml`:",
      "source_hash": 1412090535940531946,
      "context_hash": 5476116926316283150,
      "translation": "저장소의 `triagebot.toml`에 `[close]` 테이블을 추가하면 해당 저장소에서 이 기능이 활성화됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:47:20.930350Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
